{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n 本日の井口目線は\n 日向坂46キャプテンの\n 佐々木久美ちゃんです〜✨✨\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHHRW11V568SKBHFP2SAJG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHHSYK24Q200A5T2EZVY06","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 流石の美人さんです💗\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHHTX05K2JBZRV302TGDM4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHJ0WCD65MT8J8132V8EWP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ふざけてもとっても可愛くて\n \n 何より\n 井口目線に載ることに\n 密かに憧れてたと言ってくれて\n とっても嬉しかったです💕\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHJ1ZQJ2NE3BRT4GT1M6PV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHJ33HAPHV9MFB27QY9FCJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHJ469PTRKGT6354CCJ3PH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 私はいつも\n 自分が子供を産んで育てたら\n \n 久美ちゃんみたいな子に\n 成長してほしいと思ってます✨\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHJ5BDYX85QF2YE4P8MRXW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHJ6BX8WN3G5BJ6DSJ9VT0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHHHJ7CY35MPEPNRTQK8XQ47","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n こんなに可愛いのに\n こんなに立派に育つなんて\n \n 本当に奇跡✨✨\n \n いつも頼れるキャプテン\n ありがとう😊\n \n たまには私も頑張ろう（笑）\n \n \n 以上\n カメラマン井口眞緒でした"}],"source":"archive"}